---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Welcome to MS Playbook</h1>
			<p>
				Hi, I'm Christina. This is where I'm writing about life with MS — the good days, the hard
				ones, and the small strategies I pick up along the way. Think of it less as a polished
				diary and more as a playbook I'm building in real time, one entry at a time.
			</p>
			<p>
				I started this blog because I couldn't find enough honest, ordinary accounts of what this
				actually looks like day to day, and I wanted to be one more voice adding to that. If
				you're here because you're navigating something similar, I hope you find something useful
				— or at least something that makes you feel less alone in it.
			</p>
			<p>
				Head over to the <a href="/blog">blog</a> to read the latest, or visit
				<a href="/about">about</a> to learn a bit more about me.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
